<title>UK: Head of former Coke-Schweppes venture leaves.</title>
<headline>Head of former Coke-Schweppes venture leaves.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cadbury Schweppes Plc said on Friday that the managing director of Coca-Cola Schweppes Beverages Ltd (CCSB), Derek Williams, had left the board after it sold its 51 percent stake in the firm.</p>
<p>The company had announced on February 11 it was completing the sale of its stake to Coca-Cola Enterprises Inc for 622.5 million stg.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
